== riley_plans ==
Liora: So what are your plans for the future? Still the same?
Riley: Of course! My destiny to become a Knight still shines true! Like the flying pegasus steed of the Original Knight who saved the world!
Liora: Cool, cool. You got this bro.
Riley: Thank you. And you shall become not just a Royal Guardsman, not just the Court Magician, but THE subordinate and friend of RILEY the KNIGHT!
Liora: Awesome...
-> END